Just ascended for my first time today (12/27/05) on the public NAO
server.

Here's a dumplog : http://alt.org/nethack/dumplog/omni.lastgame.txt
It'll only be up until I start a new game.

Anyway this was a fevered ascension because the game previous to this
one I died in the Plane of Water (rodney appeared and doubled troubled
me). So I got really angry and feverishly tried to get where I was
again. I just wasn't prepared enough and the planes were all too weird
for me at first.

Second time around though, I was seriously prepared and kicked some
butt. The hardest parts for me were actually the first encounter with
the Wizard of Yendor (he stole my eye of aethiopica, so he resisted
death), who also double troubled. I have no idea how I survived that
encounter. Moloch's Sanctum was kind of hectic too. After that the
planes went real easy, and the Astral Plane went sorta smoothly, even
though it was very new to me. The only rider that gave me problems was
Pestilence. Famine and Death were disposed of quickly.

So for my first ascension I did a genoless polyless conduct, next time
I'll either try another role and/or more conducts. I also scored #831
on the top 2000 list!

Well...time to take a break on the nethack...or start another game.


